            "text": "Looking at A3, the asparagus for the salmon dish is a major cost driver. Given it's a seasonal menu, we could substitute it with green beans or even roasted broccoli, which are more cost-effective and easier to prep in bulk. This would likely bring the dish back in line without touching the salmon portion.",
